      "card_ids": ["C03", "C04", "C12", "C15", "C21"]
    },
    {
      "claim": "L3 saxagliptin AUC records show measurable oral exposure for an adamantane-containing small molecule (AUCinf about 145–153 ng·h/mL), supporting oral absorption of this structural class, although no IV comparator or absolute F is reported.",
